  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#38;</mo><mi>B</mi></math> are mixed</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#38;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> are mixed</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S<